{
  "id": "RAW_2583005440",
  "title": "如何使用原生 JavaScript 构建更智能的商城搜索",
  "url": "https://www.sitepoint.com/how-to-build-smarter-marketplace-search-with-vanilla-javascript/",
  "date": "2026-10-05 23:00:07",
  "author": "Jhon-Harry",
  "siteName": "SitePoint",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>A marketplace search feature often begins as a text box connected to <code>Array.prototype.filter()</code>. That approach works for a small prototype, but users quickly expose its limitations.</p>\n  <p>They may search for “blue wall print” when a listing is titled “Coastal Evening.” They may enter words in a different order, use uppercase letters, or search for a subject that appears only in the product tags. A strict title comparison will miss results that are clearly relevant.</p>\n  <p>Before adding a dedicated search service, developers can build a more useful first version with structured metadata, normalized text, weighted fields, filters, and predictable sorting. This tutorial explains how to create that search layer with vanilla JavaScript.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-start-with-structured-listing-data\">Start with structured listing data</h2>\n  <p>Search quality depends heavily on the information available to the application. If every detail is stored inside one long description, the system has little control over matching and ranking.</p>\n  <p>Use a consistent structure for each marketplace listing:</p>\n  <pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript code-highlight\"><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> listings <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">id</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"art-101\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">title</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Coastal Evening\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">description</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"An abstract sunset above a quiet shoreline.\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">category</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"abstract\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">colors</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"blue\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"orange\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">tags</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"coastal\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"sunset\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"wall art\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">price</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">42</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">createdAt</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"2026-08-10\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">available</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">id</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"art-102\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">title</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Quiet Forest\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">description</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"A minimal green woodland illustration.\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">category</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"nature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">colors</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"green\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"cream\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">tags</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"forest\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"minimal\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"botanical\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">price</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">35</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">createdAt</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"2026-09-02\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">available</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">id</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"art-103\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">title</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"City Geometry\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">description</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Geometric architecture in black and gold.\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">category</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"architecture\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">colors</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"black\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gold\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">tags</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"city\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"geometric\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"modern\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">price</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">55</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">createdAt</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"2026-07-21\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">available</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span></code></pre>\n  <p>Dedicated fields make the data easier to validate, filter, and index. They also allow the interface to offer category, color, availability, and price controls without trying to extract those values from descriptions.</p>\n  <p>A production database should enforce a schema so that listings do not alternate between values such as <code>wall-art</code>, <code>wall art</code>, and <code>Wall Art</code>.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-normalize-both-listings-and-queries\">Normalize both listings and queries</h2>\n  <p>Users do not enter perfectly formatted searches. They add extra spaces, mix uppercase and lowercase letters, and sometimes use accented characters.</p>\n  <p>Create a normalization function before comparing values:</p>\n  <pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript code-highlight\"><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">normalizeText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">value</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> <span class=\"token known-class-name class-name\">String</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">normalize</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"NFKD\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">replace</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token regex\"><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-source language-regex\"><span class=\"token char-set class-name\">\\p{Diacritic}</span></span><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-flags\">gu</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">toLowerCase</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">replace</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token regex\"><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-source language-regex\"><span class=\"token char-class\"><span class=\"token char-class-punctuation punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token char-class-negation operator\">^</span><span class=\"token char-set class-name\">\\p{Letter}</span><span class=\"token char-set class-name\">\\p{Number}</span><span class=\"token char-set class-name\">\\s</span><span class=\"token char-class-punctuation punctuation\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-flags\">gu</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\" \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">replace</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token regex\"><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-source language-regex\"><span class=\"token char-set class-name\">\\s</span><span class=\"token quantifier number\">+</span></span><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-flags\">g</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\" \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">trim</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span></code></pre>\n  <p>The function converts values to strings, removes common diacritical differences, changes text to lowercase, replaces punctuation with spaces, and collapses repeated whitespace.</p>\n  <p>Build a searchable string for every listing:</p>\n  <pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript code-highlight\"><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">createSearchDocument</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">listing</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token spread operator\">...</span>listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">searchText</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token function\">normalizeText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">description</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">category</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token spread operator\">...</span>listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">colors</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token spread operator\">...</span>listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">tags</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">join</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\" \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> searchableListings <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> listings<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  createSearchDocument\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span></code></pre>\n  <p>Precomputing <code>searchText</code> avoids repeatedly normalizing every listing after each keystroke. It is a small optimization, but it also keeps the search function easier to understand.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-match-every-query-term\">Match every query term</h2>\n  <p>A single <code>includes()</code> check works when the entire query appears in the same order inside the listing. It performs poorly when a user searches for multiple concepts.</p>\n  <p>Split the query into terms and require every term to appear:</p>\n  <pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript code-highlight\"><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">matchesQuery</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> terms <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">normalizeText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">split</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\" \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">filter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token known-class-name class-name\">Boolean</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>terms<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">length</span> <span class=\"token operator\">===</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> terms<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">every</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">term</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">searchText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">includes</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>term<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span></code></pre>\n  <p>A query such as “blue coastal print” now checks each word independently. The words do not need to appear beside one another or in the same field.</p>\n  <p>SitePoint’s introduction to <a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/filtering-and-chaining-in-functional-javascript/\">filtering in functional JavaScript</a> provides additional background on building smaller datasets with array methods.</p>\n  <p>This approach is still deliberately simple. It does not automatically understand synonyms, spelling mistakes, or semantic similarity. However, it provides predictable behavior that developers can inspect and test.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-give-important-fields-more-weight\">Give important fields more weight</h2>\n  <p>Not every match should have the same value. A word appearing in the title usually provides a stronger signal than the same word appearing near the end of a description.</p>\n  <p>Create a scoring function:</p>\n  <pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript code-highlight\"><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">calculateScore</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> terms <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">normalizeText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">split</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\" \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">filter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token known-class-name class-name\">Boolean</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> title <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">normalizeText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> category <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">normalizeText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">category</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> tags <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">normalizeText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">join</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\" \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> description <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">normalizeText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">description</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> terms<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">reduce</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">score<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> term</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">includes</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>term<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>category<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">includes</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>term<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tags<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">includes</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>term<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">includes</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>term<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> score<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span></code></pre>\n  <p>The numbers are not universal rules. They are product decisions that should be adjusted using real searches and user behavior.</p>\n  <p>Do not hide the ranking logic inside a large conditional block. Named weights or a configuration object make experiments easier and allow developers to document why one field influences results more than another.</p>\n  <p>Discovery is especially important for independent creators who cannot rely entirely on paid promotion. This overview of <a href=\"https://artdaily.com/news/200735/Selling-art-prints-on-Etsy--how-artists-get-found-without-paying-for-ads\">how artists get found without paying for ads</a> illustrates why titles, descriptive listing information, and organic discovery matter on crowded marketplaces.</p>\n  <p>The technical lesson is straightforward: the platform can only rank signals that it collects consistently.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-combine-search-with-explicit-filters\">Combine search with explicit filters</h2>\n  <p>A text query answers one part of the user’s intent. Filters handle requirements that should not depend on keyword matching.</p>\n  <p>For example, a customer may want abstract artwork under $50 that is currently available:</p>\n  <pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript code-highlight\"><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">searchListings</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  listings<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    query <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    category <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    maxPrice <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">Infinity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    availableOnly <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> listings\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">filter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">listing</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token function\">matchesQuery</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">filter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">listing</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token operator\">!</span>category <span class=\"token operator\">||</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">category</span> <span class=\"token operator\">===</span> category\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">filter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">listing</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">price</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> maxPrice\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">filter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">listing</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token operator\">!</span>availableOnly <span class=\"token operator\">||</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">available</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">listing</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token spread operator\">...</span>listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">score</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token function\">calculateScore</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>listing<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">sort</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">a<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> b</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">score</span> <span class=\"token operator\">!==</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">score</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">        <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> b<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">score</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">score</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Date</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">createdAt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">        <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Date</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">createdAt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span></code></pre>\n  <p>The function first removes listings that fail the query or filters. It then calculates relevance scores and sorts matching items.</p>\n  <p>When two listings have the same score, the newest appears first. A marketplace could instead use popularity, rating, stock level, or a carefully controlled combination of signals.</p>\n  <p>Avoid making commercial priorities invisible. If sponsored or promoted listings affect order, label them clearly rather than presenting payment as organic relevance.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-debounce-the-input\">Debounce the input</h2>\n  <p>Running a small in-memory filter after every keystroke may be acceptable for a few hundred records. Server-backed search should not send a request for every input event.</p>\n  <p>A reusable debounce function delays work until the user pauses:</p>\n  <pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript code-highlight\"><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">debounce</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">callback<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> delay <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">250</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> timeoutId<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token keyword control-flow\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\"><span class=\"token spread operator\">...</span>args</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token function\">clearTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>timeoutId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    timeoutId <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token function\">callback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token spread operator\">...</span>args<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> delay<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> searchInput <span class=\"token operator\">=</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token dom variable\">document</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">querySelector</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"#marketplace-search\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">searchInput<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token method function property-access\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token string\">\"input\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token function\">debounce</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">event</span> <span class=\"token arrow operator\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">searchListings</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      searchableListings<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">        <span class=\"token literal-property property\">query</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">target</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">value</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">        <span class=\"token literal-property property\">availableOnly</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token function\">renderListings</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span></code></pre>\n  <p>Debouncing reduces repeated work, but the delay should remain short enough that the interface feels responsive.</p>\n  <p>If the search calls an API, an older request may still finish after a newer one. SitePoint’s guide to <a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/how-to-prevent-stale-api-responses-with-abortcontroller/\">preventing stale API responses with AbortController</a> explains how to cancel outdated requests and prevent them from replacing current results.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-design-a-useful-empty-state\">Design a useful empty state</h2>\n  <p>“No results” is technically accurate but rarely helpful. The interface should show users how to recover.</p>\n  <p>When no listings match:</p>\n  <ul>\n   <li>\n    <p>Display the current query and active filters.</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Offer a button to clear all filters.</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Suggest removing one restrictive filter.</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Show related categories when appropriate.</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Preserve the user’s query while filters change.</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Avoid automatically replacing the search with unrelated products.</p>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>Also distinguish between an empty result and a failed request. Users should not see “No products found” when the API actually timed out.</p>\n  <p>Accessible status messages should announce the result count without moving keyboard focus:</p>\n  <pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html code-highlight\"><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>p</span>\n</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token tag\">  <span class=\"token attr-name\">id</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-status<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token tag\">  <span class=\"token attr-name\">role</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>status<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token tag\">  <span class=\"token attr-name\">aria-live</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>polite<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span>\n</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&gt;</span></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>p</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">&gt;</span></span>\n</span></code></pre>\n  <p>Update the text with a message such as “12 listings found” after rendering the results.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-know-when-the-browser-is-no-longer-enough\">Know when the browser is no longer enough</h2>\n  <p>In-memory JavaScript search is appropriate for prototypes, small catalogs, offline interfaces, and internal tools. It becomes less suitable as the catalog grows or ranking requirements become more complex.</p>\n  <p>Consider a server-side index when you need:</p>\n  <ul>\n   <li>\n    <p>Typo tolerance</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Synonym management</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Language-aware stemming</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Faceted result counts</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Geographic search</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Permission-aware results</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Large or frequently changing datasets</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Analytics-driven ranking</p>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <p>Consistent results across clients</p>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>Even after moving to a search service, keep the data model and normalization rules explicit. A dedicated engine cannot compensate for missing categories, inconsistent tags, or vague product titles.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-final-thoughts\">Final thoughts</h2>\n  <p>Useful marketplace search does not begin with a complicated search engine. It begins with structured listing data and clearly defined matching rules.</p>\n  <p>Normalize text, search across relevant fields, weight strong signals, apply filters separately, debounce user input, and design helpful empty states. These steps provide a transparent foundation that developers can measure and improve.</p>\n  <p>When the catalog eventually requires more advanced infrastructure, the marketplace will already have the clean metadata and product decisions needed to make that transition successfully.</p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "一份关于如何使用原生 JavaScript 构建健壮商城搜索系统的指南，重点关注结构化数据、规范化、加权评分和高效过滤。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "一份关于如何使用原生 JavaScript 构建健壮商城搜索系统的指南，重点关注结构化数据、规范化、加权评分和高效过滤。",
  "summary": "本文介绍了如何超越简单的数组过滤，创建一个功能完备的商城搜索功能。涵盖了关键技术策略，例如为了更好的索引而对元数据结构化、规范化用户输入以处理大小写敏感和重音符号，以及实现加权评分算法以使标题等字段优于描述。作者还讨论了将文本搜索与显式过滤器结合的最佳实践、通过防抖（Debouncing）处理输入以优化性能，以及设计可访问的空状态以提升用户体验。",
  "mainPoints": [
